    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Observe the World of ALife</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the<strong> ALife</strong>; mysterious, charming beings who survive by consuming ore. Let\u2019s watch their endearing yet sometimes frustrating lives unfold. Their body colors change based on the ores they consume. When an ALife consumes a lot of ores, it gives birth to offspring. What colors and personalities will the newborns have?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553790/extras/4ae2c21f23f59b292c872c973d593ffc.avif?t=1753916378\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Play Without Playing</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot control or upgrade ALife. All you can do is observe and watch over them. They walk, eat, and grow. From parent to child, and from child to grandchild. Observe the lives of ALife as they span across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553790/extras/7c3269c78da632c8fdcfb8c8ac7e1081.avif?t=1753916378\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How to Observe</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find an ALife you like and click on it. You can zoom in to observe up close or zoom out to see the bigger picture. With the auto-camera feature, the view will rotate automatically. The more you watch, the more you may discover about the lives of ALife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553790/extras/a35939eb5e887dfdb8ca7bb78fd97810.avif?t=1753916378\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Dress-Up</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of ALife offspring you witness directly translates to your score. Use your points in the shop to unlock new outfits for them. As generations pass, new dress-up options become available. The outfits you purchase will be worn by ALife from the next generation onward. Find your favorite combinations and enjoy their new looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553790/extras/e4f34d9b1ae27cbd8b642b319b4e9ce9.avif?t=1753916378\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Different Ways to Enjoy</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in a slow-paced world with soothing BGM. Perfect for studying, working, or as a backdrop to your daily life. Supports both windowed and fullscreen modes. Since you don\u2019t need to control anything, you can stay focused on your own tasks. However, if you stop observing midway, the generation count you\u2019ve watched so far will reset. The more you cherish ALife, the more it may boost your concentration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553790/extras/161e0817f80d87c299f03b4554279883.avif?t=1753916378\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*macOS support is coming soon.</p>",
